That portion of the SW¼ SE¼ Sec. 31, T. 56 N., R. 95 W., lying within 25 feet of the center line of the transmission-line right of way of the Mountain States Power Company is subject to the terms and conditions of section 24 of the Federal Water Power Act as amended (U.S.C., title 16, sec. 818).

